    "title": "Pok\u00e9mon TCG Pocket",
    "description": "Pok\u00e9mon cards, played with by people in 89 countries, are now closer to you than ever!\r\n \r\nEnjoy Pok\u00e9mon cards anytime, anywhere, on your mobile device!\r\n\r\n \u25a0 You can open packs every day to get cards!\r\nCollect cards every day! You can open two booster packs every day at no cost to collect Pok\u00e9mon cards featuring heartwarming illustrations from the past as well as all-new cards exclusive to this game.\r\n \r\n \u25a0 New Pok\u00e9mon cards!\r\nImmersive cards, a brand-new kind of card, make their debut here! With new illustrations that have a 3D feel, immersive cards will make you feel like you\u2019ve leapt into the world of the card\u2019s illustration!\r\n \r\n \u25a0 Show off your collection!\r\nYou can use binders or display boards to showcase your cards and share them with the world!\r\n \r\n \u25a0 Casual battles\u2014alone or with friends!\r\nYou can enjoy casual battles during quick breaks in your day!\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.apppokemon.com/tcgp/kiyaku/kiyaku001/rule/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Pok\u00e9mon cards, played with by people in 89 countries, are now closer to you than ever!<br> <br>Enjoy Pok\u00e9mon cards anytime, anywhere, on your mobile device!<br><br> \u25a0 You can open packs every day to get cards!<br>Collect cards every day! You can open two booster packs every day at no cost to collect Pok\u00e9mon cards featuring heartwarming illustrations from the past as well as all-new cards exclusive to this game.<br> <br> \u25a0 New Pok\u00e9mon cards!<br>Immersive cards, a brand-new kind of card, make their debut here! With new illustrations that have a 3D feel, immersive cards will make you feel like you\u2019ve leapt into the world of the card\u2019s illustration!<br> <br> \u25a0 Show off your collection!<br>You can use binders or display boards to showcase your cards and share them with the world!<br> <br> \u25a0 Casual battles\u2014alone or with friends!<br>You can enjoy casual battles during quick breaks in your day!<br><br>Terms of Use: https://www.apppokemon.com/tcgp/kiyaku/kiyaku001/rule/",
